WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.935
Dramatic moments ago,

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:02.736
just moments ago

00:00:02.736 --> 00:00:04.371
in a Buffalo, New York, courtroom

00:00:04.371 --> 00:00:05.572
where the man who shot and killed

00:00:05.572 --> 00:00:06.673
ten people

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:07.674
at a grocery store in

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:09.609
Buffalo is now facing sentencing.

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:10.477
Barbara Massey,

00:00:10.477 --> 00:00:12.479
the sister of one of the victims,

00:03:28.708 --> 00:03:30.009
as we see that unfold.

00:03:30.009 --> 00:03:32.812
Do we know who this man was?

00:03:32.812 --> 00:03:34.347
We don't at this point,

00:03:34.347 --> 00:03:36.482
but obviously the audience was filled,

00:03:36.482 --> 00:03:38.251
filled with a lot of family,

00:03:38.251 --> 00:03:39.352
a lot of people who

00:03:39.352 --> 00:03:40.553
were directly related,

00:03:40.553 --> 00:03:42.422
either friends or otherwise,

00:03:42.422 --> 00:03:45.225
with with the people that were killed by

00:03:45.692 --> 00:03:46.926
Payton Gendron, who,

00:03:46.926 --> 00:03:48.261
of course, he's been convicted of that

00:03:48.261 --> 00:03:48.861
at this point.

00:03:48.861 --> 00:03:49.429
And look,

00:03:49.429 --> 00:03:51.631
we knew this was going to be emotional.

00:03:51.631 --> 00:03:52.332
We knew that

00:03:52.332 --> 00:03:53.933
they were going to be up to 17

00:03:53.933 --> 00:03:55.735
people who were going to speak obviously,

00:03:55.735 --> 00:03:57.537
this is a tragedy that has shaken

00:03:57.537 --> 00:03:58.371
not just Buffalo,

00:03:58.371 --> 00:03:59.105
but places

00:03:59.105 --> 00:04:00.907
across the world, too, to its core, but

00:04:00.907 --> 00:04:02.642
especially in Buffalo.

00:04:02.642 --> 00:04:04.444
But but to see this

00:04:04.444 --> 00:04:05.612
level of anger

00:04:05.612 --> 00:04:06.112
was something

00:04:06.112 --> 00:04:07.680
I think you can see the surprise

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:08.781
on a lot of people's faces

00:04:08.781 --> 00:04:09.616
when this happened.

00:04:09.616 --> 00:04:11.117
But obviously right before that,

00:04:11.117 --> 00:04:11.784
the victim impact

00:04:11.784 --> 00:04:13.253
statement was being given by Barbara

00:04:13.253 --> 00:04:14.787
Massey was already emotional

00:04:14.787 --> 00:04:16.155
she wasn't speaking into the mix.

00:04:16.155 --> 00:04:17.056
She was turned

00:04:17.056 --> 00:04:20.126
and speaking directly at Payton Gendron.

00:04:20.126 --> 00:04:21.361
She wanted him

00:04:21.361 --> 00:04:23.596
to understand what he had done

00:04:23.763 --> 00:04:24.931
to this community.

00:04:24.931 --> 00:04:26.432
To these people,

00:04:26.432 --> 00:04:28.334
to these loved ones, for for everyone

00:04:28.334 --> 00:04:30.270
that was sitting inside of there.

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:32.405
Another thing was that now

00:04:32.572 --> 00:04:33.339
now the hearing is

00:04:33.339 --> 00:04:34.173
is back on track,

00:04:34.173 --> 00:04:35.708
we should say, that the judge

00:04:35.708 --> 00:04:37.176
trying to get things back

00:04:37.176 --> 00:04:38.077
under control

00:04:38.077 --> 00:04:39.212
did acknowledge

00:04:39.212 --> 00:04:40.947
that we know this is emotional.

00:04:40.947 --> 00:04:42.515
We know that this may be difficult

00:04:42.515 --> 00:04:43.182
for people to hear.

00:04:43.182 --> 00:04:45.285
But but please leave the courtroom

00:04:45.318 --> 00:04:47.820
if you feel like you can't control that.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:48.955
Also saying that

00:04:48.955 --> 00:04:50.623
that we are better than this

00:04:50.623 --> 00:04:51.057
as far

00:04:51.057 --> 00:04:52.892
as acting on some of those

00:04:52.892 --> 00:04:54.861
aggressive emotions, perhaps

00:04:54.861 --> 00:04:55.495
but obviously it's

00:04:55.495 --> 00:04:57.363
indicative of what we are

00:04:57.363 --> 00:04:58.965
dealing with in the sentencing hearing.

00:04:58.965 --> 00:05:00.667
And those moments are among

00:05:00.667 --> 00:05:01.634
the most dramatic

00:05:01.634 --> 00:05:03.002
I think I've seen in recent memory.

00:05:03.002 --> 00:05:03.703
I've got to say,

00:05:03.703 --> 00:05:05.471
I'm amazed it doesn't happen more often.

00:05:05.471 --> 00:05:06.706
I can only imagine the anger

00:05:06.706 --> 00:05:07.540
and the hatred of the people

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:08.341
involved there.

00:05:08.341 --> 00:05:09.242
Omar, thanks so much

00:05:09.242 --> 00:05:10.043
for bringing that to us.

